ilar to those of Dobby  despite their good nature if a brownie  is provoked or angered they will become  a Bhagat given a brownie honey once they  become a Bhagat is said to calm them and  allow them to return to their natural  state in some folklore it states that if  you make the creature a new suit and  they wear it they will vanish forever  and never be seen or heard from again  this seems to be where JK Rowling had  her idea of Harry given Dobby the sock  in order to release him from the Malfoy  family like most bogus brownies are said  to be invisible to anyone who doesn't  possess the second sight buckets are  such interesting creatures because  they're depicted in so many different  manners their surroundings determine  what type of creature they become a  helpful hand around the house can  quickly turn into a mischievous and even  evil spirit if the wrong thing is said  or done if you've enjoyed this video  then please go ahead and leave it a like  consider subscribing if folklore  mythology is something that interests  you if you have anything you'd like to  discuss or have any ideas for future  videos then please go ahead  and let me know in the comments below as  always I've been your host mythology and  folklore explained  [Music]
 

